{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返しをする中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一回、自己紹介とかしてほしいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という声があったので、まだまだ私のことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく知らない って方のためにも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、詳しく自己紹介しますね！(*^_^*)うしっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっと...、小百合って名前は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"百合の花に 由来しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それも、植物が好きな 祖父の影響で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔からうちの庭には、立派な 松ノ木や、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥などの動物の形に整えられた植木、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盆栽や、沢山の花たちが いっぱいあったのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中に ぽつん って、毎年 一輪だけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鉄砲百合が 咲くそうなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別に、種を植えた訳でもないのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その百合は、強く根をはって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年  花を咲かせます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこから、その百合の花のように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凛とした美しい女性になってほしいと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名付けられました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、(鉄砲)百合の花言葉は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"威厳・純潔・無垢 です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も、お花がすごく好きだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花の中でも、やっぱり百合が一番好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出身地は、埼玉県です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉が大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、５人兄妹の４番目です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人しくて内気とみられることが多いですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実際は、めちゃくちゃ楽観的で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おっとりゆるゆる、陽気な人間です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにちょっかい出すのも大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから周りの人からは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ギャップがすごい！」と、よく言われます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、言われなかったことはありませんヽ(；；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は、大人しいと思ってたのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなキャラだったの？！って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもびっくりされちゃいます( ^ω^; )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなんだから、お仕事でキリっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"している井上を、周りの知り合いは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たことがないであろう(●＾u＾●）えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、友達をすごく大事にしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと仲良くて、大切な友達がいっぱい居ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"離れても、お手紙くれたり、メールくれたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"埼玉に握手 行ったときも、わざわざ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで応援にかけつけてくれたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホント、泣かされてばかりです＾＾笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「小百合がＣＭとかテレビにでる度に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠い存在のような気がしてしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも小百合は小百合です。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達がデビューのときにくれたメール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度も励まされました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今でも、地元に帰るとみんなが集まってくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって、友達は本当に大切な存在です(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"離れても、ずっと仲良しです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛は、小さい頃からずっと ショートです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり派手なのとか苦手なタイプだったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、ばっさりショートでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部活は、中学・高校と ずっと吹奏楽部です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習は恐ろしくきつくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"礼儀や身だしなみに関しても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり厳しい部活でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学では、コンサートミストレス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校では、学生指揮者をやっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"担当は、テナーサックス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前は、テナ夫 と名付けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５年間 可愛がっていました＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"軽音もやってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"担当は、ボーカルです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌うことが大好きなので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと歌っていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"SCHOOL OF LOCK!リスナーです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いのが とても苦手です(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人ごみも すごく苦手です...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃブログにも載ってましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べるのが、物凄く遅いですω･`;;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肉まん１つに４０分...（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"戦隊以外に好きなものと言ったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオジブリです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな作品は、「耳をすませば」です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吹奏楽で、ジブリを演奏するにあたって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジブリ作品について勉強し始めてから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その世界観に魅了されてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雫ちゃんが可愛くって大好きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雫ちゃんの真似をして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく学校帰りに 図書館へ行って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読書や勉強をしてました(*^_^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストーリーもそうですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何よりジブリの音楽が大好きです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久石譲さんを崇拝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな色は、白です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな動物は、アンゴラうさぎ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなキャラクターは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラム マサナガ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、マイメロちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"趣味は、花柄やアンティークな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物を集めること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森ガールとか山ガールとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわしたキレイな人に憧れます○°"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは、自然がすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物が好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将来は、地元のほうに戻って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森で静かに暮らしたいです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、大阪にて握手ですねっ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新幹線にて～。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、おやすみなさい～＾＾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sayunyanヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/28/4600163/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}